Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比较当世人们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we compare the present life of man on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和那些已无从考据的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that time of which we have no knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得就像一只小小麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems to me like the swift flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在某个冬日 飞过宴会大厅的那一瞬\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a single sparrow through a banqueting hall on a winter's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那片刻的绚丽后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a few moments of comfort,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便消失在自己曾出现过的冬日景致中\N{\fnArial\fs30}he vanishes from sight into the wintry world from which he came.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个人只在这个世界上 出现那短短的一瞬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so, man appears on earth for a little while,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这短短一瞬前后的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but of what went before this life or what will follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都不得而知\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}In these last days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于失去 我想了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been thinking a great deal about loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 一个人失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What loss, Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是最无法挽回的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to man the most irrecoverable?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}His virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过行动 他可以重拾德操\N{\fnArial\fs30}For by his actions, he may redeem his virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的 总有办法可以挽回\N{\fnArial\fs30}For again, he may find the means to recover it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同他可以重获他失去的财产一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}even as a man recovers some fortune he has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就想不到了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I cannot say, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时间 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有我们失去的东西里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all losses,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间是最无可挽回的\N{\fnArial\fs30}time is the most irrecuperable,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们不能回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}for it can never be redeemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（王后凯瑟琳·帕尔的逮捕令）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:02:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心保管这份文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并送交给李斯里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give it to my Lord Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国最高上将大人到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord High Admiral of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好 大人 法兰西的贵宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salutationes Domine, Praefectus Magnus Galliae.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谨此代表吾父亨利八世 欢迎您的光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvete Regis Enrici octavi maiestatis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能拜访贵国是我至高的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my great privilege and honor to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上将大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我引荐两位公主 玛丽小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present His Majesty's daughters…the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊莉莎白小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchant?.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到可以受到陛下家人 如此热诚的接待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought to be welcomed in this cordial way by His Majesty's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我们的贵客啊 德尼波上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but you are a very special and honored guest, Admiral D'Annibault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外您的造访也正合时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your visit most timely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想陛下应该快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure His Majesty will be here presently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德大人似乎深得陛下信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Hertford seems to be in the King's good graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear it seems to be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵势力正日涨夜窜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl grows more powerful daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全因陛下体弱而他又控制着储君\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of the King's infirmity and his control of the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下驾崩后愿上帝助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help us then if the King should die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我也有耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have heard many say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不少人士更希望您登基为女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the people would rather see you anointed as Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是把国家交给\N{\fnArial\fs30}than leave the country at the mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个孩子和他自负的舅舅\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a mere child and an overweening uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那王后又将如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您很快… 能听到相关政论\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shall hear more on that subject…very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很欣慰能和法国签订新协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are very pleased to make a new treaty with France.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和德皇之间将不再有任何联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have no further business with the Emperor…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他曾多次背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has betrayed me at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证我们将是您忠实的伙伴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure Your Majesty that you will find us good and faithful friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不会像德皇那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}unlike the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该有所耳闻 在我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, in my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已进行了不少宗教改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have made many changes to religious life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我重塑了曾经腐败堕落的教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have reformed a corrupt church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我驱除了数百年来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have swept aside hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谎言和迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}of lies and superstitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向各族人民揭露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have revealed to all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇并非上帝的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Pope is but a fallible prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不过是会犯错的凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not the voice of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些无疑你都应该听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this, no doubt, you'll have heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然知道陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am certainly aware that Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在您的国家实施了很多变革\N{\fnArial\fs30}has wrought many changes-in your own kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那如果我们要联盟 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we are going to be allies, Monsieur,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我建议一个更深远的变革\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I propose a further change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议在两国境内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I propose that Mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部废除弥撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}be abolished in both our realms…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由一种简单的圣餐礼来代替\N{\fnArial\fs30}and replaced with a simple communion service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how would you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我没有权力重议协定条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I have no authority to renegotiate the terms of our treaty…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也知道 尤其是在吾王病危之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially, as Your Majesty knows, my King is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅毒 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of syphilis, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very sorry to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.30,0:07:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认识弗朗西斯很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have known Francis a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请务必转告我的慰问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I beg you to send him my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也一并告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you may also tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的疾病即意味着他的凡人之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his disease is a reminder of his own mortality!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时过境迁 他恐怕已经忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, in times past, he has forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有东西要给王后看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something for you to show the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该要交给李斯里大人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to take it to Lord Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藏好了 王后看完后还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide it. When the Queen's read it, give it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好俊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 妹妹 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hush, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁在嚎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是… 是王后陛下 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's the Queen's Majesty, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她为什么嚎成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is she screaming like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go and see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我有所不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have grown displeased with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何出此言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怕你已经彻底抛弃我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear that you have… utterly forsaken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事让你有此顾虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has caused you to think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么原因会让我对你不满意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I have reason to be displeased with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有对我不满吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not displeased with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will ask you one more time:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么原因会让我不满吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any reason I should be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is none, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妹妹 夫人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister! Ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你们都要按我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you must do as I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}销毁所有私藏的书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear your coffers of all books…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论你觉得它们是不是禁书\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you suppose them to be forbidden or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从今往后 无论如何 我们的谈话将不再涉及\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on we shall talk no more, amongst ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何宗教或有争议的议题\N{\fnArial\fs30}of any matters, whether religious or controversial,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也将竭尽所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I shall try, in all things,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来迎合国王的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}to conform myself to the King's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快行动 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 赫德福德大人 - 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Hertford. - Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安\N{\fnArial\fs30}good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能见公爵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I be presented to His Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很不巧 大人 公爵身体欠安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, my Lord, His Grace is indisposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他身感风寒 现在还卧床不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He caught a chill and is still abed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very sorry to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等公爵身体好了 我再来拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will return some other time, when the Duke is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见你我还撑得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am well enough to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么可以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Que fais-tu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用担心 亲爱的 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ne t'inqui?te pas, ma Cherie. Je vais bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人请\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为你那派现在正和加德纳主教派\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your faction is engaged in a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斗得你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Bishop Gardiner and his.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会对您有所隐瞒 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not hide the truth from you, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王身体羸弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's infirmity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我侄儿尚且年幼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the youth of my nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:12:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这使得继位问题如箭在弦\N{\fnArial\fs30}make the question of succession urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赌注已博到了极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stakes could not possibly be higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没猜错的话 你想要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you desire to know, I assume,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我站在谁那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}on which side of the argument I belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 无论您是否在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, whether you will it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您对国王的影响可谓举足轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}you carry a great weight of confidence and influence with the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点大家都了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是很少有人知道您的妻子 公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But fewer people know that your wife, the Duchess,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同我的妻子 安 加上王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my wife Anne, together with the Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在宗教信仰上可谓亲密无间\N{\fnArial\fs30}are as close on matters of religion as it is possible to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种亲密关系让我有勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this close affinity has emboldened me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此时此刻同您敞开心扉\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, to approach Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信您妻子有告诉您 公爵夫人同我已形同路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely your wife has told you that the Duchess and I are estranged!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的好恶已与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus her affinities are not necessarily my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你却强加在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you do me a disservice to assume they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 请原谅我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}your Grace, forgive me…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我甚至原谅你把傲慢可怜的萨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you even for hounding poor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逼到绝路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}proud Surrey to his death…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总归那是他咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}for it was his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是说到宗教信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as to religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没读过福音书 也不打算读\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never read the Gospels-and never shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信福音书给你带来了启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure they enlighten you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但对我而言 我宁愿它们保持神秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I prefer them to remain mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于承诺中更好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, as for the promise of a better world,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能说英格兰曾经是那么美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only say that England was merry before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更广义来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all things considered,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望一切都能回到从前的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would all things were as they used to be in times past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 如果我得不到您的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, if I do not have your support…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可否请教您是否会抵制我\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I ask if you will act against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道这能算不算给你的答案 赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure if this is any answer, my Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很崇尚法国农夫的一句名言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have always been drawn to a phrase used by the French peasants:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「感谢上帝赐予的一切」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Praise the God of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「喝杯酒」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"drink the wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「让一切顺其自然」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and let the world be the world."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德夫人到 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Hertford, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知为何被传召至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was summoned here but I have no idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么能帮你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder how I may help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 告诉我实情 就是对我最大的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may help me, my Lady, by telling me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 你是最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a friend, I believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被施火刑的异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the heretic Anne Askew,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安·阿斯科的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的确与她相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was acquainted with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想不只是相识吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were more than acquainted, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在狱期间 你的一个仆人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}While she was a prisoner one of your servants…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个穿蓝色外套的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man wearing a blue coat…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向她提供过钱财\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave her money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望她不会太受罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desired to make her circumstances more tolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是作为教徒的慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only acting out of Christian charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说有人非法刑讯逼供\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had been informed that those who tortured her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她绑在架子上拉扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}illegally, had stretched her on the rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到四肢筋肉坏死\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the strings of her arms and legs were perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你承认她是公开的异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you admit she was a self-confessed heretic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此你同她有染本身就够定罪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are therefore guilty by association.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有逮捕令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a warrant for my arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会用这张逮捕令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never serve that warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我知道你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么秘密 赫德福德夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What secret, my Lady Hertford?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你装得像个圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not such a saint as you appe…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实不然 对不对 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你并没有放弃世俗的物质追求吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not exactly renounced worldly goods…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}康沃尔郡有两座修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two monasteries in Cornwall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在陛下的命令下被问抄 关闭 烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were stripped and closed, on His Majesty's orders, and burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可事实上他们根本没被问抄亦或烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that they were neither stripped nor burnt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其财产都被秘密转移到了大人名下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but their titles and contents were quietly transferred to Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是很富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus you are a rich man indeed…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但都是从国王那里偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only by embezzling from the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议你撕了这张逮捕令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I advise you to tear up your warrant,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 王后陛下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, Her Majesty the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate. Come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am glad you have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能替我解开一些疑惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can resolve me of certain doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 我在想你能从福音书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder, Kate, how much you think you can learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和其他宗教书籍中学到多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}from reading the Gospels and other religious books?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然上帝已任命您 作为我们的最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}since God has appointed you as Supreme Head of us all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将从您那里获悉上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is from you that I will ever learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 但事实并非如此啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but that surely is not so!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经是学者了 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have become a doctor, Kate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:18:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经见识过好多次了 你已经在指导我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to instruct us-as we have seen many times before…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不需要被我们指导了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not to be instructed or directed by us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我想您误会我的意图了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I think my meaning has been mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直认为女人来指导 她的夫君是多么荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I have always held it preposterous for a woman to instruct her Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候你的宗教观念同我们大相径庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seem sometimes to have a different view of religion than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我需要您的指正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only so that you could correct me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原以为谈话和讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I thought that talking and discussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以为您驱散疾病带来的病痛和苦闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}helped to ease the pain and weariness of your present infirmity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的大胆进言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it encouraged me in my boldness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是极度渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the hope of profiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从您那里获取真理的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your learned discourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 我只是一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, I am but a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女性的柔弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the imperfections natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}导致了诸多天生的缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the weakness of my sex…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}and therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何疑惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all matters of doubt and difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都会以陛下的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must refer myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为最终指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Your Majesty's better judgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是我的主人和领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}as my Lord and head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实如此吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你的主张实则好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you made your argument for no worse ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们可以和好如初了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are perfect friends again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢恩典 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会再对你有所怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I will never doubt you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:19:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 需要我废除明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, shall I rescind Your Majesty's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮捕王后的命令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to arrest the Queen tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梦到我们在布洛涅的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were back in Boulogne…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把你放走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 黎明了吗 - 还没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has the dawn come yet? - Not yet. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讨厌夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会让人以为是永恒的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make you think of perpetual night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黎明即将到来 你也会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dawn will be here soon, and you well again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 布里奇特… - 我在 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brigitte… - Yes, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特… ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大法官 所为何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Chancellor! Why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来执行王后的逮捕令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to execute the warrant for the Queen's arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并将夫人送往伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to escort her, and her Ladies, to the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knave!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.20,0:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你个彻头彻尾的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You arrant knave!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.60,0:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚 别让我看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 原谅我… - 滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty, forgive me. - GET OUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也把你的跟屁虫给带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take your bastards with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我… 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很遗憾大法官会\N{\fnArial\fs30}?? the Lord Chavcellor should.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犯这样的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}make such a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他完全不值得你同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't how little he deserves your sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是你的朋友 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was not your friend Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 赫德福德大人 - 赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord Hertford! - My Lord Hertford!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我已经解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, I have already explained,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他骂我是混蛋 火气冲天\N{\fnArial\fs30}he called me a knave! All manner of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是他是骂给谁听的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for whose ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能他是想警告王后 她还未能宽心放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposing he still wants the Queen to feel falsely secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算他是装生气 我觉得那也是冲着我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was feigned anger, it seemed very real to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.10,0:23:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位大人 国王缺席\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, in the King'sbsence,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议会依然在此聚集以表决是否赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Council is called upon to declare its content.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同法国的和平协议条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the terms of the peace treaty with France.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 赞成请说「是」 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All in favour say "aye" - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议会还需要讨论 关于王位继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Council is also called upon to discuss all arrangements made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.90,0:23:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the security and safety of His Highness Prince Edward,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.30,0:23:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安全事宜的诸项安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}heir to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及他继承俗权\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all provisions made for his temporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和神权的各项条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spiritual welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, pray,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.90,0:23:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出于何种目的导致 您现在提出这样的议题\N{\fnArial\fs30}what induces you to discuss such things now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.70,0:23:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如上涉及的条件已毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all such provisions are already made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:24:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王子按照陛下的命令 在温莎也安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Prince is secure at Windsor, by His Majesty's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是啊 - 的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye. - true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Hertford,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议会依然有义务确认以上事宜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Council is still constituted to examine such matters…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其正当国王疾病缠身\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially since the King's infirmities.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.80,0:24:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们更有必要防范于未然\N{\fnArial\fs30}give us all cause to think of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.10,0:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大法官大人 预示国王身故\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is treason, my Lord Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.50,0:24:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 乃叛国行为 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to envisage the King's death! - Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.50,0:24:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 这不是为了王子着想嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, all our concern is for the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为了王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your concern?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你忘记了他是我的血亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you forgetting that he is of my blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也是国王的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is also of the King's blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.30,0:24:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这让我们有足够的理由来确保 照顾王子的人和事都安全妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gives us cause enough to examine those put in charge of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.90,0:24:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恰恰我们发现 这些人当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And among them, some of whom we find,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如他的老师 就可能是异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}like his tutors, to be suspected heretics!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你凭什么叫嚣异教 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk of heresy! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是什么东西 不过是 依仗着教皇狐假虎威的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you but a puffed-up porkling of the Pope's?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.10,0:24:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.70,0:24:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我依然要说 赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still say…My Lord Hertford…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对王子和王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the real truth behind your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.50,0:25:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真正的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards the Prince and the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.80,0:25:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定高于你对国王的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}must be placed before the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.64,0:25:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你干了什么？ - 把手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Take your hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加德纳主教请求面见陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop Gardiner desires an audience with your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位大人天性爱惹是生非\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace has a troublesome nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想在这里再看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't want to see him here ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请他离开宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire him to leave my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.35,0:25:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.30,0:25:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 陛下命令您离开宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, His Majesty instructs you to leave court.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.30,0:26:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 赫德福德大人 - 赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Hertford. - Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.06,0:26:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大法官大人 有何赐教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Chancellor. What may I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你接受 我恳请你原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may forgive me, if you find it possible to do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我过去交友不慎 现在万分悔恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}from some past associations, which I now regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:27:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意全心全意忠于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no hesitation in pledging my utter loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.70,0:27:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人的阵营\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Your Lordship's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将来我亦将如效力于陛下一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I trust in future I can serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.30,0:27:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为你尽犬马之劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}as faithfully as I have always served His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是万分荣幸 大法官大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am most grateful to you, my Lord Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.10,0:27:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔拜因大师到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.60,0:27:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 霍尔拜因大师 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Holbein. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.10,0:27:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个任务交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a commission for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很荣幸 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am most grateful to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.40,0:27:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想陛下指的是肖像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume Your Majesty means a portrait?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.40,0:28:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为我父亲著过肖像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once painted my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.90,0:28:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你来替我画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will paint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.90,0:28:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深感荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am deeply honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.30,0:28:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下有口谕\N{\fnArial\fs30}here is a messenger from His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.00,0:28:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下听闻您身体不适\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has heard of your indisposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要见您\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has asked to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.30,0:28:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不可能 你去问问医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is impossible. Ask the physicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.40,0:28:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我该如何向陛下回禀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall I tell His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.60,0:28:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.30,0:28:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.90,0:28:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能你不能去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:28:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 英格兰国王召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I lie in bed, my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:28:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么能躺在床上置之不理呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the King of England has summoned me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.40,0:29:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get them to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.20,0:29:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.50,0:30:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来看我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to see my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这让你吃惊了吗 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should that surprise you, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.40,0:30:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你并没有善待她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not always been kind to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到她孤苦无依\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have wept so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被自己的父亲抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see her alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.20,0:30:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我常常泣不成声\N{\fnArial\fs30}abandoned by her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是为了这个回来的吗 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you've come back, Katherine,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.80,0:30:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为莫须有的事指责我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to chide me for all that I am not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.10,0:30:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她早该成婚为人妻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ought to be a long time married by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.80,0:30:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也早该为人母了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ought to have her own children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开 幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away, shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.90,0:30:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away, Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前你就抛下了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me away before…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我依然爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}though I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.90,0:30:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在上帝眼中 从前我就一直是你的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was still your wife in God's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在依然还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still am.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.90,0:31:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨福克公爵到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.70,0:31:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.20,0:31:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说你病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you were ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.40,0:31:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我必须见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I had to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.10,0:32:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是有点发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a slight fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.43,0:32:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下请不要靠太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Your Majesty should not come so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们相识已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've known each other a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往事历历在目\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.20,0:32:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 记忆中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很久以前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}things from long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.10,0:32:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比昨日之事 更加鲜活如新\N{\fnArial\fs30}better than I remember yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.00,0:32:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忘不了陛下的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember Your Majesty's sister so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.10,0:32:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有陛下赐封我公爵之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when Your Majesty made me a Duke…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:32:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有上帝明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows why!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.20,0:33:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我在约克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were my general,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.00,0:33:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和法国的大将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}in York and in France,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我只信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I could trust no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 查尔斯 我要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I beg you now Charles,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.10,0:33:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有力量让你恢复健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the power to make you well again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.21,0:33:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.30,0:33:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说你快要死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you were like to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.50,0:33:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forbid it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.90,0:33:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.00,0:34:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝在上\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the grace of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.10,0:34:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 亨利八世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, the Eighth Henry…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.90,0:34:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰 爱尔兰 法兰西国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of England, Ireland, and France…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真理及英格兰教会的捍卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defender of the Faith and of the Church of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.90,0:34:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}命令你痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}command you to be healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨福克公爵夫人 - 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lady Suffolk. - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.90,0:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我代表大人 所有忠实的奴仆和同僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I say, on behalf of all His Grace's loyal servants and staff,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.60,0:35:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这样悲恸的日子里 我们同夫人您一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we are as heart-broken and wretched.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.90,0:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万分遗憾 悲痛欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Your Grace must be on this unhappy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.70,0:35:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们深爱着大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we all loved His Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.90,0:35:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同夫人您 作为他妻子 和他的儿子并无不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}as much as you, his wife, and son, loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.70,0:35:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的慰问和忠诚 让我和犬子深受感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sympathy and loyalty touch my son and I most deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.50,0:36:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requiescant in pace Domini.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.50,0:36:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿永恒之光普照于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et Lux perpetua luceat eis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.40,0:36:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requiescant in pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.20,0:36:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他葬在温莎的圣乔治教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is to be buried at St George's Chapel at Windsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.90,0:36:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费用由我承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}At my expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.30,0:36:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.90,0:36:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来告诉你 赫德福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you this, my Lord Hertford:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.50,0:36:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在查尔斯·布兰顿替我效力期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as Charles Brandon served me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.70,0:36:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从未背叛过一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}he never betrayed a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.10,0:36:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也从未对敌人采取不光彩的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor ever… took unfair advantage of an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.50,0:37:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我担保 在我的宫廷里 没有其他人可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is more than I can say for anyone else at my court!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没想过他会离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought he would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德大人 我们应该讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should talk, my Lord Hertford,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.70,0:37:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我死后该如何妥善安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the arrangements for the Prince's minority…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年幼的王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I am dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.70,0:37:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 霍尔拜因大师到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, Mr. Holbein is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.60,0:37:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔拜因大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.30,0:37:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.90,0:37:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您允许我向您展示肖像画的进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your permission, I came to show you my work in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.50,0:38:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔拜因大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.50,0:38:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为我父亲画肖像时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you painted my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.10,0:38:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把他画得\N{\fnArial\fs30}you made his likeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.00,0:38:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年老 体衰\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he was old, sickly, and ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.30,0:38:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他完全不像英格兰国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked nothing like a King of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.40,0:38:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更像个可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}more like a poor wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个虚弱平庸的将死之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A feeble, plain, and dying man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.50,0:38:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你又要在我身上重蹈覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you have done the same for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.70,0:38:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.50,0:38:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔拜因大师 这幅肖像是个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. HOLBEIN! This portrait is a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.60,0:38:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.30,0:38:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.60,0:39:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.70,0:39:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.70,0:39:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是我生命中唯一的圣洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the only pure thing in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.80,0:39:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我生时缺忽略了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in my life I neglected her,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.90,0:39:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就因为她只是女儿身 我多想给你生个王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}since she was only a girl, and I wanted so much to give you a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.90,0:39:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在我是如此为她骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I am so proud of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.70,0:39:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常骄傲 她很聪慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiercely proud! She is so clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.20,0:39:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然在很多方面 她很像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And though she is like me in so many ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.00,0:39:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不像我那么恃才而骄\N{\fnArial\fs30}she is not intemperate as I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.50,0:39:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也为她骄傲吧 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be proud of her too, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.80,0:40:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也替她骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very proud of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.90,0:40:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也知道她非常聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know how clever she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我能再多爱她一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish that I could love her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.60,0:40:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是时不时得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会让我想起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}she reminds me of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.40,0:40:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and of what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什么都没做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did nothing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.90,0:40:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.20,0:40:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有对我的指控都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the accusations against me were false.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.60,0:40:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Katherine Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.80,0:40:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她躺在冰冷的地下 就我在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lies in the cold ground next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.80,0:40:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor child.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.90,0:40:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也不是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not her fault either.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:41:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我们就像两只飞蛾 不顾一切地扑向烈火…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were like two moths, drawn to the flame…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.20,0:41:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}燃成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.70,0:41:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne, please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.80,0:41:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty, the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.70,0:41:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.00,0:41:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.10,0:41:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Elizabeth…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.60,0:41:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.30,0:42:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.90,0:42:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.70,0:42:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送你们去格林威治\N{\fnArial\fs30}to send you away to Greenwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.40,0:42:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今年我不会和你们一起过圣诞节…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not spend Christmastide with you this year…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.70,0:42:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}or thereafter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 您何出此言 陛下 - 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why, Your Majesty? - Kate,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.70,0:42:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要质疑我的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not question my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.60,0:42:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.40,0:42:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.28,0:42:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.00,0:42:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要负担起当你弟弟慈母的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be a kind and loving mother to your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.00,0:42:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走后\N{\fnArial\fs30}who I leave in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将成为孤苦无依的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a helpless little child.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.90,0:42:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 我求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, father, I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.30,0:42:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别让我那么快成为孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not leave me an orphan so soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.50,0:42:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.40,0:43:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.30,0:43:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.10,0:43:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是那么年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so very young,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.20,0:43:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你也要照顾好你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you, too can look after your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.80,0:43:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.20,0:43:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿主保佑你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.80,0:43:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.00,0:43:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.80,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候说永别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time has come for us to bid farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是上帝的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is God's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.80,0:43:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.70,0:44:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要求这些先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I order these gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.90,0:44:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要如我在世时那样尊敬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to treat you as if I were living still.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.90,0:44:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你有意改嫁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it is your pleasure to remarry,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.00,0:44:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你有生之年 我会留给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I order that you shall have 7, 000 pounds a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.90,0:44:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每年七千英镑的花费\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as you live for your service,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.70,0:44:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以留着所有的珠宝和首饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as your jewels and ornaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.90,0:44:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.40,0:45:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我儿还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.50,0:45:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.00,0:45:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.80,0:45:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他照顾得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}???
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.30,0:45:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的简\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweet Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.60,0:45:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很快会成为国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon, he will be King.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.40,0:46:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可怜的儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.30,0:46:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My poor child.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.90,0:46:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.70,0:46:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是最受宠爱的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the most beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.10,0:46:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我最重要的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is my special boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.50,0:46:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将在花季之年早逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will die young.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会的 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.30,0:46:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的孩子 你对他期望太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor child…you expected too much of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.00,0:46:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was only a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.10,0:46:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是君王也是血肉之躯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kings, too, are made of clay!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.50,0:46:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么可以把他隔离在世界之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God forbid you locked him away from the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.00,0:46:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你父亲对你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like your father did with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.80,0:46:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.70,0:46:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经扼杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.40,0:46:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.20,0:47:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位臣工 以下将是我的遗诏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herewith, my Lords, is my testament.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.60,0:47:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I am dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.40,0:47:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在爱德华王子成年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}my Lord Hertford will act as Lord Protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.70,0:47:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德福德大人将为护国公\N{\fnArial\fs30}during Prince Edward's minority.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.20,0:47:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并由大法官李斯立\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be supported by my Lord Chancellor Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.50,0:47:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和大主教克兰麦辅佐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Archbishop Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.00,0:47:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我遗愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.50,0:47:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将我埋在温莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be buried next to the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.50,0:47:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我此生挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my true and loving wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.80,0:47:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简·西摩尔王后身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Jane Seymour, at Windsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.40,0:47:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}建一个体面的祠堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall raise an honorable tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.70,0:47:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要有我们的肖像\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon which will be our effigies,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.30,0:47:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}音容笑貌要栩栩如生 好似我们只是在沉睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}fashioned as if we are sweetly sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.90,0:49:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.50,0:49:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.70,0:49:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔拜因大师在礼拜堂等您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holbein awaits you in the Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.90,0:52:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔拜因大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Holbein,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.80,0:52:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.70,0:53:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利八世卒于1547年1月28日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry VII died on January 28, 1547.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.90,0:53:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他唯一的嫡出王子在九岁时 登基为爱德华六世\N{\fnArial\fs30}His sole legitimate son became King Edward VI at the age of nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.80,0:53:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六年后因病去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to die of illness six years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.30,0:53:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的长女玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}An attempt was made to prevent the King's eldest daughter, Princess Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.30,0:53:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因其天主教信仰 继位一度受到阻挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}from becoming Queen because of her Catholic beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.80,0:53:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最终在1533年登基为女王 她的统治短暂而血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was crowned in 1533. Her Reign was short and turbulent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.00,0:53:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她焚烧了很多新教徒殉道者 史称「血腥玛丽」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She burned many protestant martyrs, and became known as "Bloody Mary".
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.90,0:53:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她同父异母的妹妹伊丽莎白 于1588年继位 史称「童女女王」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her half-sister, Elizabeth, succeeded her in 1558.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.90,0:53:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白统治英格兰长达44年之久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known to history as the Virgin Queen, Elizabeth ruled England for forty-four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.90,0:53:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她统治时期被称为「黄金时代」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Reign was called "The Golden Age".
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.30,0:54:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利八世和伊丽莎白一世\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Henry VIII and Elizabeth I,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.80,0:54:11.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都铎王朝诞生了两位 英国史上最著名的君主 《都铎王朝》全剧终\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Tudor dynasty produced the two most famous monarchs in English history.
